invalid type: string "Guide 7: How to Connect to Campus Wi-Fi and Report Network Issues\nStep 1: Connect your device to the SSID 'CampusConnect-Student-WiFi'.\nStep 2: When the captive portal opens, enter your university student email and portal password.\nStep 3: Accept the security certificate and click 'Connect'.\n4 to 48 hours.
